            0.357,
            0.539,
            0.884,
            0.689
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Modern technologies have made online platforms available for all to obtain information, make connections, interact, and share information with each other. We should use these platforms responsibly for the collective well-being of all. Sometimes, we, knowingly or unknowingly, use social media platforms carelessly. Seeking guidance from elders and teachers can help use these platforms positively."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
